==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*5 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kaijin Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns.
**2 [[Bore]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**15 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is heavily advised to obtain ALL of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1, 2, and 3, or else enemy magnifications will become nigh-impossible to surmount. Stall and chip the opening Aliens using 3 cheap meatshields, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]], and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]], then start stacking [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]] on them to prepare for the boss wave. Once your cats reach the enemy base, start spawning [[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Blue Nyanko Rangers]] to quickly take care of the Bores. It will inevitably become a back and forth, but once the second Bore goes down, you can stop spawning Ranger Cats entirely to conserve cash. You win once Ursamajor dies.

